  <metadata>
    <name>Jackpot Ultras Long Course loop</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates copy the 225-point "Long Course" line from Aravaipa Running's CalTopo map (caltopo.com/m/T3R0R9M), exported 2026-08-13 and linked from the official race page. The loop is USATF-certified at 2.3094 miles (NV23003MWC); the drawn line measures 2.35. The Long Course 100 Mile runs 43 full loops plus a final short loop at Cornerstone Park, Henderson, NV. The waypoint is the organizer's Start / Finish marker, home of the 24/7 Main Strip Aid Station.</desc>
    <link href="https://caltopo.com/m/T3R0R9M"><text>Jackpot Ultras Long Course CalTopo map</text></link>
  </metadata>
